### Software Engineering Principles – Before vs After

| Aspect | Before (Manual Event Emission) | After (Outbox Pattern) |
|--------|--------------------------------|------------------------|
| Transactional safety | Manual try/catch, risk of lost events | Atomic DB write + outbox guarantees |
